# Open Ends tracker (Flaux HQ)

This repo has an Open Ends tracker at `OPEN_ENDS.md` tracked by Flaux HQ.

- When you fix something listed there, tick it (`- [x]`) in the same change (or delete the line), or mention `closes OE: <item text>` in the commit message.
- When you notice a new bug, SEO gap, missing client input, or unbuilt feature while working, add it under the right section as `- [ ] text #priority`. Do not fix unrelated things without asking.
- Never rename or remove the section headings (`## Bugs`, `## SEO`, `## Client inputs needed`, `## Features to build`, `## Content`, `## Performance & accessibility`, `## Launch & infra`).
- Never put secrets, passwords, or API keys in the tracker.
